    "Camera: %@\nFormat: %@ · %@ · %@\nFrame rate: %@ fps\nOverdrive: %@\nMedia: %@\nRate: %@ %@/h · %@ Mb/s\nPlan: %@ h · %@\nAvailable recording time: %@\nVideo estimate only; verify camera firmware, codec and media before production.": {
